Description:
  The Add Company and Edit Company dialogs, shared by both halves of Companies.

  Both screens create and edit the same record through the same routes, so the forms live here once
  rather than in each list partial. A second copy is a second thing to keep in step, and the company
  type field in particular has a rule attached to it that must not exist in only one of them.

  The System Company cannot be disabled or deleted, and its form pins the company type so the
  invariant cannot be broken from this screen. The refusal itself lives in the repository, not here.

  The rows to build Edit dialogs for arrive as one parameter, so each screen passes its own dataset.

  WARNING: a template comment is not a safe place to document syntax. A comment delimiter
  written inside a comment body ends the comment early and leaks the remainder onto the page.
  Keep every comment plain prose: no comment delimiters and no code, not even to document one.
Changelog:
  2026/09/07 17:20 SAST
  - Extracted from the Companies list partial when Companies split into two screens.
